WEBVTT

00:16:59.806 --> 00:17:01.933
You came to Europe

00:17:03.268 --> 00:17:07.564
and even here we've spoken
about the everyday sexism

00:17:07.564 --> 00:17:08.899
that you experience

00:17:08.899 --> 00:17:12.778
and how exhausting it is to educate men

00:17:12.778 --> 00:17:15.989
on issues around gender equality.

00:17:17.949 --> 00:17:19.284
Are there parallels?

00:17:19.284 --> 00:17:23.580
Do you see any opportunities
for us to learn from each other?

00:17:23.622 --> 00:17:26.541
Because I know many people
in the audience will feel your pain

00:17:26.583 --> 00:17:29.044
and recognize that exhaustion.

00:17:29.086 --> 00:17:30.629
How do we learn from each other?